The Xiaomi Mi Router 4A (MIR4A) 100M **Chinese version** is an indoor wireless router based on the MediaTek MT7628AN SoC, with three 10/100 Ethernet ports (2xLAN + 1xWAN), dual band 802.11b/g/n+ac (dual radio) WiFi and four external non-detachable antennae. The original model ships with v2.x Chinese firmware and box bears **SKU DVB4222CN**.

International version also has a different Flash layout ("OS1" starts at 00da0000)

